# Rules
- Reply in Korean. Code identifiers in English.
- Unity 2D, C#, WebGL MVP; preserve existing Unity version and project conventions.
- `Docs/GDD.md` is the approved gameplay source of truth; `Docs/DECISIONS.md` records approved changes. If unclear, ask; do not invent rules.
- Inspect relevant files before editing. Modify the fewest files possible; no unrelated refactors, packages, or features.
- Prefer simple built-in Unity components; serialized Inspector fields for tuning. Avoid speculative abstractions.
- Do not claim Unity compilation, Play Mode, MCP, or browser testing unless actually performed.
- After edits report only: changed files, what works, test evidence, blockers. Keep concise.

# Unity Project Location
- Unity project root: CandyThief/
- Unity Assets directory: CandyThief/Assets/
- Unity Packages directory: CandyThief/Packages/
- Unity ProjectSettings directory: CandyThief/ProjectSettings/
- All Unity scripts, scenes, and prefabs must be created inside CandyThief/Assets/.

